Package: cleanresults
Title: Publication-Ready Regression Tables for Multiple Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Shaye", email = "shaye.mcd@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits linear, logistic, and mixed-effects regressions for one or
    more dependent variables and renders a single publication-ready table with
    robust standard errors, explicit reference categories, pairwise contrasts,
    and multiple-comparison corrections within factors and across outcomes.
    Tables render natively in Quarto (HTML, Word, PDF) and export to Word,
    LaTeX (Overleaf), and HTML that pastes cleanly into Google Docs.
